ing satire on those, which really doesn't narrow down who I could be talking about at all.<br /> <br /> Seems to me the Hegemony could make use of such ephemeral Hunter cells to prop up the concept of Unity by attacking the memories of atrocities as &quot;too triggering to commemorate&quot;, or perhaps to encourage the desire to &quot;create safe spaces&quot; free of oppressive conflict of differing ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please don't use my fiction to imply the concepts of trigger warnings and safe spaces are not only evil, but the tools of the Exarchs. I really don't fucking appreciate that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 08-22-2016, 11:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T21:07:07-07:00","id":956135,"title":"","content":"Evil? I don't believe my language was that intense. I very much like what you wrote and that you are displeased on how I would apply the concept you've creatively conjured up is not the reaction I expected. That being said, I would say in games I rule trigger warnings and safe places are definitely tools of the Lie to keep people from being challenged (see Adamantine Arrow) towards awaking, forced to think for themselves and freely express themselves (see Free Council), explore mysteries of the past without chauvinism of modern morality (see Mysterium). Unity is explicitly of the Exarch of the Hegemony, and can't more Unity than multiculturalism supported increasingly in most US colleges that I've step foot on and read about in the new in the past half-decade.<br /> <br /> Is multiculturalism evil? Are safe places and trigger warnings evil? These are not as important questions as one may think, because evil requires will and these are just abstract concepts that exist. I do personally believe they have catastrophic consequences when applied dogmatically without introspection or honest observation and feed-back based on measurable results, but that's pretty much true of any pure ideological policy, belief system, and/or '<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oz9fX_HfsXA\" target=\"_blank\">ism</a>'s. Reality is a bit complicated to have easy answers.<br /> <br /> Please feel free to disagree, (disagreements can be healthy and productive) and know that while you may not appreciate my interpretation of your art, I do appreciate your creativity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 08-23-2016, 12:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T21:13:00-07:00","id":956137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956135#post956135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Evil? I don't believe my language was that intense. I very much like what you wrote and that you are displeased on how I would apply the concept you've creatively conjured up is not the reaction I expected. That being said, I would say in games I rule trigger warnings and safe places are definitely tools of the Lie to keep people from being challenged (see Adamantine Arrow) towards awaking, forced to think for themselves and freely express themselves (see Free Council), explore mysteries of the past without chauvinism of modern morality (see Mysterium). Unity is explicitly of the Exarch of the Hegemony, and can't more Unity than multiculturalism supported increasingly in most US colleges that I've step foot on and read about in the new in the past half-decade.<br /> <br /> Is multiculturalism evil? Are safe places and trigger warnings evil? These are not as important questions as one may think, because evil requires will and these are just abstract concepts that exist. I do personally believe they have catastrophic consequences when applied dogmatically without introspection or honest observation and feed-back based on measurable results, but that's pretty much true of any pure ideological policy, belief system, and/or '<a href=\"http://&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oz9fX_HfsXA&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">ism</a>'s. Reality is a bit complicated to have easy answers.<br /> <br /> Please feel free to disagree, and know that while you may not appreciate my interpretation of your art, I do appreciate your creativity.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am saying, in the gentlest of terms, that you arguing my politics are tools of incarnate symbols of oppression aimed at actively worsening the human standard of living and supressing our race's inherent potential on a creative work I created is Pretty Shitty. Please stop.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 08-23-2016, 12:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T22:46:23-07:00","id":956169,"title":"","content":"Unity is also explicitly a ministry built around the unifying power of <i>xenophobia</i>. Which is why it's basically folly to try and tie the symbols of the Ascension War too closely to any given political concept; with almost every case both sides can exploit the concept in their own way. This is also a feature for players; the version that you like/that works is clearly Of The Opposition, and the other Of The Man.<br /> <br /> Plus the Temenos terrorism of the egohackers causes confusion and chaos because most of those things you <i>can't</i> forget - it just causes temporary disruption as the temenos realms and objects reform. These folks are not sophisticated temenotic engineers, they're a mob of banishery sleepwalkers with a gloss of ideological paint in their eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T08:11:53-07:00","id":956324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956135#post956135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Evil? I don't believe my language was that intense. I very much like what you wrote and that you are displeased on how I would apply the concept you've creatively conjured up is not the reaction I expected. That being said, I would say in games I rule trigger warnings and safe places are definitely tools of the Lie to keep people from being challenged (see Adamantine Arrow) towards awaking, forced to think for themselves and freely express themselves (see Free Council), explore mysteries of the past without chauvinism of modern morality (see Mysterium). Unity is explicitly of the Exarch of the Hegemony, and can't more Unity than multiculturalism supported increasingly in most US colleges that I've step foot on and read about in the new in the past half-decade.<br /> <br /> Is multiculturalism evil? Are safe places and trigger warnings evil? These are not as important questions as one may think, because evil requires will and these are just abstract concepts that exist. I do personally believe they have catastrophic consequences when applied dogmatically without introspection or honest observation and feed-back based on measurable results, but that's pretty much true of any pure ideological policy, belief system, and/or '<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oz9fX_HfsXA\" target=\"_blank\">ism</a>'s. Reality is a bit complicated to have easy answers.<br /> <br /> Please feel free to disagree, (disagreements can be healthy and productive) and know that while you may not appreciate my interpretation of your art, I do appreciate your creativity.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have to disagree with you on this. While you bring up the vulnerability of other &quot;ism's&quot; to being used without introspection, you do specifically comment on inclusive behaviors. It leads one to believe from how you wrote your use atamajakki's work that your interpretation of inclusive behaviors should be taken as an objective one. That begs the question as to why you chose those over other historical and cultural practices that have more effectively reinforced a revisionist moral history.Take for example the push back that La Raza studies faced from Tucson politicians even though they had been seeing significant improvement in academic outcomes for these marginalized populations.(<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=76Y0Z8NmHyY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=76Y0Z8NmHyY</a>). This seems to be a more clear example of overreach that also has more tangible impact. Any form of education that erases or ignores the history of marginalized communities seems to be more in the service of the Lie than these behaviors that you comment on. If anything the fact that the overwhelming amount of academic energy has been spent towards removing any critical non-western history would put the act of creating &quot;safe places&quot; as combating and struggling with the current paradigm and in turn would put that in line with the Free Council/Adamantine Arrow. While I appreciate your desire to say that reality is complicated I would still like to ask as to why you chose these behaviors over others? Is it because of your own personal discomfort and struggle? If so then that's understandable and is a better place to start a conversation. If you want to say that your experience with progressive action has been one with no measurable results or honest observation I would push back and ask if you have examined all of the empirical research done on feminism, multiculturalism, and community action. Not to mention the literature on how academic settings have existed in a paradigm to resist the inclusion of marginalized populations for longer than they have been a place of inclusion. All of that being said, Julian Rappaport of the University of Illinois made a pretty solid analysis of as to why these kind of discussions exist and why they point towards a need for an understanding of psychological and sociological phenomena that is different than the current paradigm of post-positivism or that of constructivism (<a href=\"http://grow.ie/wp-content/uploads/2012/03/In-Praise-of-Paradox-A-Social-Policy-of-Empowerment-Over-Prevention-.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://grow.ie/wp-content/uploads/20...revention-.pdf</a>). I would ask that anyone who wants to comment on the relative validity of an action in its relation to its ability to change the reality of the human condition should read this. In the end, again I would ask why specifically did you comment on those behaviors?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T10:44:16-07:00","id":956412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956137#post956137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am saying, in the gentlest of terms, that you arguing my politics are tools of incarnate symbols of oppression aimed at actively worsening the human standard of living and supressing our race's inherent potential on a creative work I created is Pretty Shitty. Please stop.</div> </div> </div> </div>He is arguing that both can equally exist and be used accordingly, not that one is better than the other or &quot;correct&quot;. Don't pretend you can control anything than yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T14:15:37-07:00","id":956538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zombiecakes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956412#post956412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He is arguing that both can equally exist and be used accordingly, not that one is better than the other or &amp;quot;correct&amp;quot;. Don't pretend you can control anything than yourself.</div> </div> </div> </div>That poster is arguing that multiculturalism is a weapon to be used against mankind and that my work is a satire against my own politics. Surely I'm well within my rights to complain about that?<br /> <br /> More importantly, can this thread please just be about my work instead of a thinly-veiled rant against what I'm increasingly certain someone will call &quot;SJWs?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T14:28:22-07:00","id":956550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956538#post956538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That poster is arguing that multiculturalism <b>is</b> a weapon to be used against mankind and that my work is a satire against my own politics.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Is</b> or <b>Can be</b>? There is a distinction, I'd think. <hr /><br /> So, are they using brute force to assault Temenos ideals? Because your average Sleepwalker isn't going to pose much threat against the Goetics there.<br /> <br /> And I assume they are oblivious to their own hypocrisy regarding &quot;Tyranny of the mind&quot; and their own brainwashing vector?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Are they using the associations of Tyranny in the Temenos to select their targets? Like &quot;Figure X&quot; is Tyrannical in the local cultural mindset, they are Priority Target?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 08-23-2016, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T14:44:13-07:00","id":956561,"title":"","content":"It's too late, Jakki. Just burn it all down.<br /> I'm not even sure how anyone could see this as a satire of SJWs. I mean... Mage is a world where, to put it simply, the SJWs are right. There is a literal Patriarchy. His name is Father.<br /> <br /> Anyway, so these guys basically see <i>all</i> Mages as being oppressors? I guess that makes sense with the whole &quot;knowledge bomb&quot; thing (<span style=\"font-size:9px\">and with the fact that even the Diamond and Free Council are still not above what amounts to slavery or stringpulling</span>), but I'm never that fond of Kill 'Em All Hunter groups. I also don't think that the Guardians--on an institutional level--would ever institute a <i>purge</i>, but I could be wrong. Still, much as the idea of it being a satire is ridiculous, it might be worth it to take some inspiration from actual radical leftist organizations like the Earth Liberation Front or whatever. But I'll admit that I'm fond of the Keepers of the Source and their hippy terrorist concept and wouldn't mind seeing more.<br /> <br /> Actually, going off of my comment from <i>that other place</i>, while it's viable in Mage to see the neo-reactionary understanding of safe spaces as being a trap, it's also viable to see such things as beneficial symbols. Perhaps the Egohackers could use that to their advantage, or try to further positive symbols (I also like Hunter Orgs that do more for the world than kill shit). Although I suppose in the context of Mage that's a bit different from, say, Werewolf, where to further positive symbols you create feedback loops by doing positive things to generate resonance; in Mage you might literally create symbols, like spraypainting runes or something. Depending on how much you want to flesh them out mechanically, you could give them Sleepwalker Merits that allow them to bring in a touch of the Supernal.<br /> <br /> That'd open up things like... otherwise non-mages who aren't touched by the Abyss or Proximi, but can still foul up or amplify certain spells. Perhaps a merit that requires being an Egohacker with the Safe Space merit that allows you to essentially shut down any violence. Perhaps by treating anyone who initiates hostilities as having the Beaten Down Tilt, and possibly even suffering a penalty equal to the dots. But perhaps that would make your problem worse, not better. Then again, I think you were going for &quot;bad guys&quot; as opposed to &quot;good intentioned but dangerous&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T14:51:26-07:00","id":956566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956538#post956538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That poster is arguing that multiculturalism is a weapon to be used against mankind and that my work is a satire against my own politics. Surely I'm well within my rights to complain about that?<br /> <br /> More importantly, can this thread please just be about my work instead of a thinly-veiled rant against what I'm increasingly certain someone will call &quot;SJWs?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>It wasn't about your politics until you started talking about your politics. He was commenting on your fiction, and what he got out of it. Then you took it personally and things got weird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T14:56:08-07:00","id":956569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956561#post956561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's too late, Jakki. Just burn it all down.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's still recoverable.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956561#post956561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> in Mage you might literally create symbols, like spraypainting runes or something.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm. What about some kind of thing using Runes as a focus for crowd sourced power? Like, by painting/making runes on things, they can focus the gestalt will of the Egohacker collective and whatever Astral symbols they've suborned to &quot;do stuff&quot;?<br /> <br /> Basically, their expansionistic viral-memetic nature isn't just a spread risk, but also a source of power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T14:59:24-07:00","id":956571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956566#post956566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It wasn't about your politics until you started talking about your politics. He was commenting on your fiction, and what he got out of it. Then you took it personally and things got weird.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whittering about how the servants of the Exarch of fascism could use the Egohackers or something like them to benefit their own causes through psychic terrorism in the name of triggers and safe spaces has wandered well out of the realm of &quot;what he got out of it.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Got any mechanics in mind for infection vectors and progression in the Egohacker state, jakki?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 08-23-2016, 06:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T16:07:28-07:00","id":956609,"title":"","content":"\u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956569#post956569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. What about some kind of thing using Runes as a focus for crowd sourced power?</div> </div> </div> </div>Holy shit that's so perfect, I love it. <br /> Though in true World of Darkness fashion, we all know that any social movement would get shut down by Hegemony and such, even more than the media buries real social movements.<br /> <br /> Also, I like how opening the minds of mortals to the powerful symbols of oppression made the Sleepwalkers turn on their creators, yet there's no &quot;oh, shit, you ever think maybe <i>we're</i> the bad guys?&quot; from the Orders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-24T04:08:54-07:00","id":956877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956609#post956609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bHoly shit that's so perfect, I love it.<br /> Though in true World of Darkness fashion, we all know that any social movement would get shut down by Hegemony and such, even more than the media buries real social movements.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but most social media doesn't spread by viral transmission, or potentially have the Astral as a vector.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956609#post956609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b<br /> Also, I like how opening the minds of mortals to the powerful symbols of oppression made the Sleepwalkers turn on their creators, yet there's no &quot;oh, shit, you ever think maybe <i>we're</i> the bad guys?&quot; from the Orders.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because that's <i>crazy</i>. <i>Obviously</i> something just went wrong, like Paradox, or interference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T01:51:27-07:00","id":958116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956877#post956877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because that's <i>crazy</i>. <i>Obviously</i> something just went wrong, like Paradox, or interference.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, <i>obviously</i> that's the only reason. The Pentacle jut needs to find out why this memetic virus makes people think <i>they're</i> oppressive, and then rework the spell to only mind control people to go after the Seers, as intended.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T10:30:38-07:00","id":958791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zombiecakes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=956412#post956412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He is arguing that both can equally exist and be used accordingly, not that one is better than the other or &quot;correct&quot;. Don't pretend you can control anything than yourself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for understanding my intent. I appreciate the notion of different points of view being able to expressed without people taking unintended offense as a ploy to silence others.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://thisibelieve.org/essay/16627/\" target=\"_blank\">http://thisibelieve.org/essay/16627/</a>.<br /> <br /> <br /> I do respectfully disagree with the politics for the reasons listed in the linked essay. I believe the disagreement is based not because either of us are looking at different evidence or a lack of intellectual work on either of our parts to build our opinions but that the work of our intellects are made on foundations of different values. To be clear, like the essay writer I value conflict because only through conflict can resolution be reached. If conflict isn't allowed only tyranny reigns. There is a season for all things, war as well peace even though the latter may superficially seem universally preferable.<br /> <br /> I am not implying my paradigm is the only valid one; that being said I've invested a good amount of time applying reason to the ideas based my values and it stands solid to my probing. I expect the same is true for those that disagree with me, based on their values. Comfort, safety, equality, and peace (any ones, not just mine) rank lower on my priorities than integrity, rationality, truth, and justice. I understand why some people may have priorities that don't match mine, and that's fine but that doesn't mean I have to change my values to match theirs. We are allowed to have different values and those different values will lead to varying world views which leads to all the diversity of thought in the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 08-27-2016, 01:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T10:53:04-07:00","id":958803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/956100-threat-the-egohackers?p=958791#post958791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you for understanding my intent. I appreciate the notion of different points of view being able to expressed without people taking unintended offense as a ploy to silence others.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://thisibelieve.org/essay/16627/\" target=\"_blank\">http://thisibelieve.org/essay/16627/</a>.<br /> <br /> <br /> I do respectfully disagree with the politics for the reasons listed in the linked essay. I believe the disagreement is based not because either of us are looking at different evidence or a lack of intellectual work on either of our parts to build our opinions but that the work of our intellects are made on foundations of different values. To be clear, like the essay writer I value conflict because only through conflict can resolution be reached. If conflict isn't allowed only tyranny reigns. There is a season for all things, war as well peace even though the latter may superficially seem universally preferable.<br /> <br /> I am not implying my paradigm is the only valid one; that being said I've invested a good amount of time applying reason to the ideas based my values and it stands solid to my probing. I expect the same is true for those that disagree with me, based on their values. Comfort, safety, equality, and peace (any ones, not just mine) rank lower on my priorities than integrity, rationality, truth, and justice. I understand why some people may have priorities that don't match mine, and that's fine but that doesn't mean I have to change my values to match theirs. We are allowed to have different values and those different values will lead to varying world views which leads to all the diversity of thought in the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't mind you disagreeing with my politics, but is a thread about a magical phone app conspiracy really the best place to talk about all of this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T11:22:15-07:00","id":958815,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">\u200bPale Crusader, stop derailing the thread and making off topic posts please. This isn't the place to talk about your personal values or political beliefs.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/